{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Сунан Абу Дауд","section":{"3":"The Book Of The Prayer For Rain (Kitab al-Istisqa')"},"section_detail":{"3":{"hadithnumber_first":1161,"hadithnumber_last":1197,"arabicnumber_first":1161,"arabicnumber_last":1197,"name_native":"Книга молитвы (Намаз)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1188,"arabicnumber":1188,"text":"Передаётся от ‘Аиши, да будет доволен ею Аллах, что в молитве, совершаемой во время затмения, Посланник Аллаха ﷺ читал аяты долго и вслух","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":3,"hadith":28}}]}